    "bankLimitScope": "bank ONLY: clamps the velocity-driven tilt (bankPerVx) during a plain \"small\" flight (flight.js line with Math.max(-F.bankLimit ...)). It does NOT cap the aerial roll: medium/large tiers add a separate 360 deg roll layer (see flight.roll). Kept because the code reads it (grep 1 use); documented per the stale-constraint rule (DIRECTIVES #06 item 2).",
    "rollIfDistOver": 260,
    "rollMs": 620,
    "glidePhase": [
      0.45,
      0.7
    ],
    "easing": "cubic-bezier(.35,.05,.25,1)",
