      "comment": "tier from rig.escalate('flight'): small = bank only, medium = 360 roll at 45 pct of the arc, large = roll + 180 heading flip; a flight longer than forceIfDistOver px is at least medium; level-off before touchdown always; prefers-reduced-motion disables all"
    }
  },
  "gaze": {
    "comment": "secondary action while talking: head and gaze react to the audio envelope, not to a fixed loop",
