      "think": {
        "comment": "K9.5-2 (owner decision 2026-09-27, item a): the think state gets its OWN calm performance instead of borrowing puzzled. Read from the G12 data (think 0/7 against a monotonic v1 gaze): fewer, slower, larger-legibility moves - eyes lead (gaze lifts up-and-away and HOLDS), head follows with a small tilt, wing to chin, one soft blink mid-hold, micro-drift so the hold is alive, then a clean settle. No spiral, no bubble, no shrug. puzzled stays untouched for confusion beats.",
